---
import BaseLayout from '../../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = 'Development Status';
const description = 'DeathEmpire is in active development, building foundational systems for future closed testing.';
---

<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} lang="en" enPath="/DeathEmpire/status/" esPath="/DeathEmpire/es/status/">
  <article>
    <header>
      <p class="section-eyebrow">DEVELOPMENT STATUS</p>
      <h1>Active Development</h1>
      <p>DeathEmpire is currently being built and refined. Public gameplay access has not yet been announced.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Current Focus</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>✓ Public world and lore presentation</li>
        <li>✓ Core project foundations</li>
        <li>◐ Gameplay system development <span class="status-badge status-dev">In development</span></li>
        <li>◐ Controlled test environments <span class="status-badge status-dev">In development</span></li>
        <li>○ Closed alpha preparation <span class="status-badge status-planned">Planned</span></li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What Comes Next</h2>
      <p>The next stage is focused on strengthening core systems, refining the world archive and preparing future testing paths.</p>
      <p><a href="/DeathEmpire/roadmap/" class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm">View Roadmap</a></p>
    </section>

    <footer>
      <p><a href="/DeathEmpire/project/">Back to The Project</a> · <a href="/DeathEmpire/chronicles/">Follow the Chronicles</a></p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
